      "widgets_values": [
        "TEXT \u2192 MUSIC: the AR LoRA patches CLIP; the NAR LoRA patches MODEL. Both strengths start at 1.\nKeep FULL mode and the ABC link. Style/section plan/seed are shared by both generators.\n120 s is a maximum. Increase to 240\u2013300 s if the section plan needs room to finish.\nFor a simple instrumental, replace the section plan with [instrumental].\nThe tokenizer head is for input recordings/training, not this text-only graph.\nThis graph keeps the original audio VAE. See docs/yue2-mothersuperior.md."
